			],
			"Message": "refactor(codebase): Refactor codebase for consistent formatting and structure\n\nStandardize code formatting across the entire Cocoon project to improve readability and maintainability. Key changes include:\n- Apply consistent indentation (tabs) and spacing\n- Reorder imports for better organization\n- Refactor service implementations for consistency\n- Update documentation with improved formatting\n- Adjust configuration files to align with new standards\n\nThis cleanup ensures that the codebase follows uniform style guidelines, making it easier to develop and maintain.",
			"SHA": "d947a2c99fb04b3e6bd1c3e9b3dd1bbbe38bd76e"
